Change to the command-line program of Unlinked (https://github.com/CosmicFrontierLabs/unlinked, Apache-2.0),
against commit cbae79996ff651d11a9189ffb197e172e539fbb3: the option --signal of `unlinked sim`, which keeps only
the listed signals in the output (without it every block output is recorded). Integration is unchanged.
Apply in a checkout of that commit with: git apply unlinked_signal_option.patch

